msgid "Scan the QR code with your wallet"
msgstr "Escanea el código QR con tu wallet"

msgid "Open your EUDI Wallet app and scan the QR code below to present your EducationalID credential."
msgstr "Abre tu aplicación EUDI Wallet y escanea el código QR para presentar tu credencial EducationalID."

msgid "Waiting for credential presentation..."
msgstr "Esperando presentación de credencial..."

msgid "Credential verified successfully! Redirecting..."
msgstr "Credencial verificada correctamente. Redirigiendo..."

msgid "Session expired. Please try again."
msgstr "Sesión expirada. Por favor, inténtalo de nuevo."

msgid "Back to login options"
msgstr "Volver a opciones de login"

msgid "Open EUDI Wallet"
msgstr "Abrir EUDI Wallet"

msgid "Tap the button to open your wallet and present your EducationalID."
msgstr "Pulsa el botón para abrir tu wallet y presentar tu EducationalID."
